OL,3,GNEWSAHaulier blames fuel prices for
OL,4,Adiesel theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Midlands haulage company has
OL,7,Fsaid thieves are motivated by rising
OL,8,Ffuel prices after they stole 400 litres
OL,9,Fof diesel.
OL,11,FMartin Pinches, director of M Pinches &
OL,12,FSons Ltd in Worcester, said the fuel
OL,13,Fwas stolen from two vehicles at the
OL,14,Fweekend.
OL,16,F"[It happened] because of the price of
OL,17,Ffuel," he claimed, adding that it was
OL,18,F"an added cost that everyone has been
OL,19,Fburdened with."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
